msgstr "Versi %(version)s &middot; di-commit pada %(date)s"

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s"
msgstr "Versi %(version)s"

# machine-translated
msgid "How signing in works"
msgstr "Cara kerja masuk"

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minute — enter it and you're signed in."
msgid_plural ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minutes — enter it and you're signed in."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tidak ada kata sandi. Masukkan emailmu dan kami mengirim kode 6 digit yang "
"berlaku selama %(num)s menit – masukkan kode itu dan kamu sudah masuk."

# machine-translated
msgid "Gravatar uses"
msgstr "yang digunakan Gravatar"

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We never store your email address itself in our database. Instead we keep a "
"one-way SHA-256 hash of it (the same scheme %(gravatar_hash_link)s)."
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak pernah menyimpan alamat emailmu di database kami. Sebagai "
"gantinya, kami menyimpan hash SHA-256 satu arah darinya (skema yang sama "
"%(gravatar_hash_link)s)."

# machine-translated
#, python-format
msgid ""
"That hash also doubles as your Gravatar id — if you have an avatar set up at"
" %(gravatar_link)s, it shows up automatically once you're signed in."
msgstr ""
"Hash itu juga berfungsi sebagai ID Gravatar-mu – jika kamu sudah mengatur "
"avatar di %(gravatar_link)s, avatar itu akan muncul otomatis setelah kamu "
"masuk."

# machine-translated
msgid ""
"Kilo fetches that avatar from Gravatar itself and keeps a copy for a day, so"
" Gravatar never sees your visits, your browser or your IP address."
msgstr ""
"Kilo mengambil avatar itu sendiri dari Gravatar dan menyimpan salinannya "
"selama sehari, jadi Gravatar tidak pernah melihat kunjunganmu, browsermu, "
"atau alamat IP-mu."

